    "Only exact h0UV selects h0V2; all other ability carriers select h03E.",
    "Summoned identity is explicit; no timed life, population or gold charge is present.",
    "FightStart sleeps 1 second; H0JIAbility has no owner, radius or alive predicate. Presence of h0JI/h0OK gates global h03E/h03F inclusion.",
    "The continuous-wave OC5F_CD path calls FightFinish, not FightStart; do not rerun H0JIAbility on every continuous transition."
  ],
